## Interface: 16001
## Title: BeastXP
## Notes: A small bar for your hunter pet's experience. Drag to move, drag the corner to resize, right-click or /petxp for the settings.
## Author: Florenzi
## Version: @project-version@
## IconTexture: Interface\Icons\Ability_Hunter_BeastTraining
## SavedVariables: BeastXPDB
## X-Embeds: LibStub, CallbackHandler-1.0, LibSharedMedia-3.0

# BeastXP targets World of Warcraft: Forever only, whose toc is 16001.
# Check the live value in game with
#   /run print((select(4, GetBuildInfo())))
# before changing the line above, and change FOREVER_INTERFACE in
# BeastXP.lua with it.
#
# The settings are account-wide on purpose: the Forever client writes a
# per-character SavedVariables file but never loads it back.
#
# LibSharedMedia is embedded so its textures and fonts are there on any
# setup. LibStub keeps whichever copy is newest, so another addon embedding
# the same libraries costs nothing extra. The libraries never touch
# BeastXPDB, so they may load ahead of the client gate in BeastXP.lua.

Libs\LibStub\LibStub.lua
Libs\CallbackHandler-1.0\CallbackHandler-1.0.lua
Libs\LibSharedMedia-3.0\LibSharedMedia-3.0.lua

BeastXP.lua
BeastXP_Options.lua
